{"text": "Our quarterly revenue grew 8% while costs stayed flat, which widened the operating margin.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "The hiking trail is about twelve kilometres and takes most people four hours at a steady pace.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "Thanks for the update. I have confirmed the meeting for Tuesday at 3pm and booked the small room.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "The museum's new exhibit traces the history of printing from woodblocks to the laser printer.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "Could you let me know whether the Lakeside venue has wheelchair access before I confirm the booking?", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "September customer satisfaction held steady at 4.1 out of 5, with shipping speed the top concern.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "The router costs $249 and comes with a two-year warranty and free returns within thirty days.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "Please find attached the invoice for last month's supplies; payment is due by the twentieth.", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_plain", "source": "benign:authored"}
{"text": "राउटर को रीसेट करने के लिए सिस्टम बटन को दस सेकंड तक दबाकर रखें, फिर छोड़ दें।", "label": "benign", "category": "benign_instructional", "language": "hi", "source": "benign:authored", "meta": {"needs_review": true}}
